SUMMARY:AVL UX: Portfolio Review
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n# AVL UX Event 3: Portfolio Review & Netwo
 rking Night\n\n**Show your work. Share your process. Get better together!*
 *\n\nAVL UX is back for Event 3!\n\nJoin Asheville's UX and product commun
 ity for an evening focused on **portfolio feedback\, professional developm
 ent\, and networking.**\n\n## **Portfolio Review**\n\nBring your portfolio
 \, case study\, or work in progress on your laptop\, tablet\, or phone.\n\
 nExperienced professionals from UX\, design\, research\, and product will 
 be available to provide feedback on:\n\n* Portfolio storytelling and case 
 studies\n* UX process and design decisions\n* Visual presentation and stru
 cture\n* Problem framing and communication\n\nReviewers will circulate thr
 oughout the event\, offering individual feedback and opportunities for dis
 cussion. Attendees can also exchange ideas\, share their work\, and learn 
 from one another.\n\n### **Portfolio Reviewers**\n\n**Reviewer lineup comi
 ng soon!**\n\n## **What to Expect**\n\n* Portfolio reviews with experience
 d professionals.\n* Peer-to-peer feedback and knowledge sharing.\n* Profes
 sional networking with Asheville's design and product community.\n\n## **W
 ho's Welcome?**\n\n**Everyone!**\nDesigners\, researchers\, product manage
 rs\, developers\, founders\, students\, career-switchers\, and anyone inte
 rested in UX and product design.\n**No portfolio? No problem!** Join us to
  learn from others\, exchange ideas\, and build connections within Ashevil
 le's growing UX community.\n\n## **Event Details**\n\n**Date:** Thursday\,
  November 12\, 2026\n**Time:** 6:00–8:00 PM\n**Venue:** 7 Acres Coworkin
 g\n**Address:** 105 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803\n**Cost:** Free\n**
 Hosted by:** AVL UX + Asheville Digital Nomads\n**Sponsored by:** Aktiga\n
 **See you there! 👋**
