SUMMARY:🍂 AVL Digital Nomads: Epic Friendsgiving Feast! 🦃
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**🌟 Fifth Annual Potluck Extravaganza 
 🌟**\n\nCalling all remote and independent workers! Get ready for the mo
 st anticipated event of the year - our Fifth Annual Friendsgiving Potluck 
 Party!\n\nWe have some surprises in store for the evening to make this eve
 nt even more special and memorable.\n\n**🎉 Why You Can't Miss This:**\n
 \n* **Connect with Your Tribe**: Whether you're a seasoned nomad or new to
  remote life\, this is your chance to mingle with like-minded adventurers!
 \n* **Feast Like Royalty**: Prepare your taste buds for an explosion of fl
 avors! From mouthwatering mains to delectable desserts\, our potluck sprea
 d is legendary.\n* **Cozy Vibes\, Cool People**: Embrace the warmth of the
  season in the company of the coolest remote workers in Asheville.\n* **Si
 p and Celebrate:** Raise a glass\, the bar is open at The Mule at Devil's 
 Foot Beverage Company\, where you’ll find an enticing selection of house
 -made non-alcoholic beverages & beer and hand-mixed cocktails. The Mule ha
 s been an incredible supporter and partner for our nomad community. Cheers
 ! 🍻🥂\n* **Introvert-Friendly\, Extrovert-Approved**: Our welcoming a
 tmosphere ensures everyone feels right at home. No awkward small talk requ
 ired!\n\n**🍽️ The Lowdown:**\n**Where**: The Mule at Devil's Foot Bev
 erage Company (Plenty of parking\, easy to find!)\n**What to Bring**: Your
  favorite dish to share (appetizer\, main\, side\, or dessert) + your awes
 ome self!\n**Bonus Points**: Label your dish and list ingredients for our 
 diet-conscious friends\n\n**🚀 Let's Break a Record!**\nJoin the fun in 
 the comments below - share what delicious dish you're bringing. Let's set 
 a Meetup comment thread record and get our taste buds tingling!\n\nWe are 
 also looking to **collect nonperishable items to donate** to various pantr
 ies around Asheville. Show your gratitude during this holiday season. Plea
 se bring canned goods\, pasta\, rice\, or other unopened nonperishable foo
 d items to contribute upon entry. (Please\, no glass!)\n\nWe will be donat
 ing to www.bountifulcities.org\n\nList of items to donate:\n\nhttps://driv
 e.google.com/file/d/1xSI0FEJdGwmbxjn9D96Qxl84ssvyGKXJ/view?usp=drive_link\
 n\n**🌈 Remember:**\nAll are welcome - newbies\, regulars\, and everyone
  in between!\nPlates\, cups\, napkins\, and utensils provided (we've got y
 ou covered!)\nBring a friend\, make a friend - double the fun!\n\nDon't mi
 ss out on this epic gathering of AVL's finest digital nomads. It's more th
 an just a meal\; it's a celebration of connection\, generosity\, and the i
 ncredible community we've built together.\n\nSee you there\, legends! 🎊
